#. な、何よ…
#. 私のどこが間違っているっていうのよ…
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What? You think s-something I said is wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ちょっと苗木、脅かさないでよ！
#. 何か変な事言ったかと思っちゃったじゃん！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"C'mon Makoto, don't scare me like that! Makes me think\n"
"something weird is going on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>あの死体の素性…
#. まずは、それを明らかにしないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We need to find out who the victim was before we can\n"
"do anything else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体の素性を明らかにする手掛かり…
#. それは、あの死体自体にあったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the one thing that can tell us...was on the\n"
"victim's own body!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
